<title>POLAND: ARIEL OCT NET FLAT AT PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>ARIEL OCT NET FLAT AT PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.56 vs   0.58</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.96 vs   0.58</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.95 vs   0.64</p>
<p> Sales		    3.12 vs   2.54</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.53 vs   2.07</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.58 vs   2.07</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.72 vs   2.38</p>
<p> Sales		   12.69 vs  10.35</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish shoe firm is Ariel SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
